WEBVTT

00:00:00.148 --> 00:00:04.265
Not sure what to build? Open Strategy, and the game suggests a plan.

00:00:04.736 --> 00:00:09.813
Choose Crustaceans, and press Play this. Then do the same for the Bird Lobster combo.

00:00:10.303 --> 00:00:13.567
The cards that build it now glow, in your hand and in the Pool.

00:00:14.129 --> 00:00:19.441
B-Lob is lobsters on the ocean floor, with a California gull on the surface above them.

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:25.061
First, the Artificial Reef. It scores two for every card attached to it.

00:00:25.531 --> 00:00:29.094
It costs one card. Pay with one that is not part of the plan.

00:00:30.512 --> 00:00:34.672
Next turn, a lobster goes on the ocean floor. Lobsters are free.

00:00:34.804 --> 00:00:38.025
Lobsters stack, so the next one goes in the same space.

00:00:40.035 --> 00:00:45.710
Now the gull goes on top. It costs two cards, so pay with two you can spare, and press Confirm.

00:00:51.788 --> 00:00:58.273
The gull scores two for every crustacean under it, and the reef scores for every card on it. That is B-Lob.
